cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "dwccheck: check a Darwin Core occurrence file locally, before you upload it to GBIF"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/dwccheck"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/dwccheck"
abstract: >-
  Checks a Darwin Core occurrence file locally, before GBIF upload, running
  the subset of GBIF's checks that can be decided from the file alone —
  required terms, controlled vocabularies, date and coordinate sanity,
  duplicate occurrenceIDs — and reporting each finding under GBIF's own flag
  names.
keywords:
  - Darwin Core
  - GBIF
  - biodiversity
  - data validation
  - occurrences
